00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:26.393 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Des personnes à mobilité réduite

00:00:14.348 --> 00:00:27.695 size:53% position:73% line:53%
travaillent de la maison.

00:00:25.459 --> 00:00:27.695 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le robot présente l'employé

00:00:26.694 --> 00:00:27.695 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aux clients.

00:00:29.797 --> 00:00:33.167 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Comme le Japon a un grave

00:00:30.998 --> 00:00:34.368 size:53% position:73% line:53%
problème de vieillissement de

00:00:32.233 --> 00:00:35.603 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la population, explique-t-il,

00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:36.804 size:53% position:73% line:53%
nous espérons permettre aussi

00:00:34.668 --> 00:00:38.005 size:53% position:73% line:53%
