00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:39.240 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à travailler de la maison."

00:00:37.104 --> 00:00:40.474 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il s'agit d'une initiative

00:00:38.305 --> 00:00:45.079 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des laboratoires japonais de

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:46.280 size:53% position:73% line:53%
